      "page_no": 1,
      "line_no_in_page": 20,
      "order": 20,
      "text": "（7）设函数$f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}&(x+1)^{2},x\\leqslant0,\\\\&x+\\frac{1}{x},x>0.\\end{aligned}\\right.$ 若函数$g(x)=f(x)-a$ 有两个不相同的零点，则实数a",
