      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L018",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 18,
      "order": 18,
      "text": "②存在在R上单调递减的函数具有性质M；",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L019",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 19,
      "order": 19,
      "text": "③存在定义域为R的偶函数具有性质M；",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L020",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 20,
      "order": 20,
      "text": "④任意定义域为R的奇函数都不具有性质M.",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L021",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 21,
      "order": 21,
      "text": "其中正确结论的序号是",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P2L022",
      "page_no": 2,
      "line_no_in_page": 22,
      "order": 22,
      "text": "## 三、 解答题（本大题共5小题，共70分。解答应写出文字说明，演算步骤或证明过程）（17）（本小题13分）",
      "block_type": "title",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L001",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 1,
      "text": "设函数$f(x)=x^{2}+(a-2)x-4\\quad(a\\in\\mathbf{R})$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L002",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "text": "（I）当$a=0$ 时，解关于x的不等式$f(x)<-1$ ；",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L003",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 3,
      "order": 3,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）若$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 在区间$\\left[-2,5\\right]$ 上是单调函数，求a的取值范围.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L004",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 4,
      "order": 4,
      "text": "（18）（本小题13分）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L005",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 5,
      "order": 5,
      "text": "已知函数$f(x)=\\frac{1-\\cos^{2}x}{\\sin x}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L006",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 6,
      "order": 6,
      "text": "（I）求$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 的定义域；",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L007",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 7,
      "order": 7,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）若$f(\\theta)=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5},\\quad\\theta\\in\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\pi\\right)$ ，求tanθ与$\\cos(\\pi-2\\theta)$ 的值.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L008",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 8,
      "order": 8,
      "text": "（19）（本小题14分）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L009",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 9,
      "order": 9,
      "text": "已知函数$f(x)=\\sin\\omega x\\cos\\omega x+\\sqrt{3}\\cos^{2}\\omega x-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}(\\omega>0)$ ，且$f(x)$ 的最小正周期为元.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L010",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 10,
      "order": 10,
      "text": "（I）求的值及$f(x)$ 的对称轴方程；",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L011",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 11,
      "order": 11,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）从条件①，条件②，条件③选择一个作为已知条件，求实数m的取值范围.",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L012",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 12,
      "order": 12,
      "text": "条件$\\textcircled{i}\\colon f(x)$ 在区间$(0,m)$ 上恰有两个不相同的零点；",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L013",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 13,
      "order": 13,
      "text": "条件$\\widehat{\\cdot\\bigcirc2}$ ：$f(x)$ 在区间$(0,m)$ 上单调递增；",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L014",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 14,
      "order": 14,
      "text": "条件③：在区间$(0,m)$ 上，$f(x)\\geqslant0$ 恒成立.",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L015",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 15,
      "order": 15,
      "text": "注：如果选择的条件不符合要求，第（Ⅱ）问得0分；如果选择多个符合要求的条件分别解答，按第一个解答计分.",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L016",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 16,
      "order": 16,
      "text": "（20）（本小题15分）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L017",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 17,
      "order": 17,
      "text": "已知函数$f(x)=\\frac{k}{4^{x}+2}\\quad(k\\in\\mathbf{R})$ ，且$f\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L018",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 18,
      "order": 18,
      "text": "（I）求k的值；",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L019",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 19,
      "order": 19,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）用函数单调性的定义证明函数$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 在R上单调递减，并直接写出$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 的值域；",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L020",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 20,
      "order": 20,
      "text": "（Ⅲ）是否存在点$\\mathit{A}(a,b)$ 「，使得函数$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 的图象关于点A对称，若存在，求实数$^{a,b}$ 的值；",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L021",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 21,
      "order": 21,
      "text": "若不存在，说明理由.",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L022",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 22,
      "order": 22,
      "text": "（21）（本小题15分）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L023",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 23,
      "order": 23,
      "text": "已知集合$A_{n}=\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbf{N}^{*}\\mid\\frac{n}{x}\\in\\mathbf{N}^{*},\\frac{n}{x}\\neq1\\right\\}$ ，且$A_{n}$ 恰有$2m\\quad(m\\in\\mathbf{N}^{*}$ 且$m\\geqslant2$ 个元素．集合$B_{1},B_{2},\\cdots,B_{m}$ 满足：① .$B_{i}\\left(i=1,2,3,\\cdots,m\\right)$ 中有且只有两个元素；",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L024",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 24,
      "order": 24,
      "text": "②$\\forall x\\in A_{n}$ ，存在唯一的$i\\in\\{1,2,\\cdots,m\\}$ ，使得$x\\in B_{i}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L025",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 25,
      "order": 25,
      "text": "记$B_{i}$ 中两个元素差的绝对值为$d_{i}$ .",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P3L026",
      "page_no": 3,
      "line_no_in_page": 26,
      "order": 26,
      "text": "（I）当$n{=}16$ 时，写出集合$A_{16}$ 及$d_{1}$ 的最大值；",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P4L001",
      "page_no": 4,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 1,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）求证：存在$x_{0}\\in A_{n}$ ，使得$n={x_{0}}^{2}$ ；",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P4L002",
      "page_no": 4,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "text": "（）是否存在n以及$B_{1},B_{2},\\cdots,B_{m}$ ，使得$d_{1}=d_{2}=\\cdots=d_{m}?$ 说明理由.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L001",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 1,
      "text": "# 参考答案",
      "block_type": "title",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L002",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "text": "## 一、 选择题(共10小题，每小题5分，共50分)",
      "block_type": "title",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L003",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 3,
      "order": 3,
      "text": "(1)A (2)C (3) B (4) C （5）A (6)B （7)B (8)C (9)D （10）D",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L004",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 4,
      "order": 4,
      "text": "## 二、 填空题(共6小题，每小题5分，共30分)",
      "block_type": "title",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L005",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 5,
      "order": 5,
      "text": "(11)$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ (12)$(-\\infty,0)\\bigcup(0,1)$ （13）7",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L006",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 6,
      "order": 6,
      "text": "（14）0（答案不唯一）",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L007",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 7,
      "order": 7,
      "text": "（15)130064（16）②③④",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L008",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 8,
      "order": 8,
      "text": "## 三、 解答题(共5小题，共70分）",
      "block_type": "title",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L009",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 9,
      "order": 9,
      "text": "(17）(共13分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L010",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 10,
      "order": 10,
      "text": "解：（I）当$a=0$ 时，$f(x)=x^{2}-2x-4$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L011",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 11,
      "order": 11,
      "text": "由$f(x)<-1$ ，得$x^{2}-2x-3<0$ ，即$(x-3)(x+1)<0$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L012",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 12,
      "order": 12,
      "text": "则$-1<x<3$ ·",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L013",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 13,
      "order": 13,
      "text": "所以不等式$f(x)<-1$ 的解集是$\\left\\{x\\middle|-1<x<3\\right\\}$ 6分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L014",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 14,
      "order": 14,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）$f(x)=x^{2}+(a-2)x-4$ 的对称轴为$x=-\\frac{a-2}{2}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L015",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 15,
      "order": 15,
      "text": "若$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 在区间$\\left[-2,5\\right]$ 上是单调函数，",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L016",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 16,
      "order": 16,
      "text": "$$则-\\frac{a-2}{2}\\leq-2 或 -\\frac{a-2}{2}\\geq5$$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L017",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 17,
      "order": 17,
      "text": "解得$a\\geqslant6$ 或$a\\leqslant-8$",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L018",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 18,
      "order": 18,
      "text": "即$a\\in(-\\infty,-8]\\cup[6,+\\infty)$ …13分",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L019",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 19,
      "order": 19,
      "text": "(18)(共13分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L020",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 20,
      "order": 20,
      "text": "解：（I）依题意，$\\sin x\\neq0$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L021",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 21,
      "order": 21,
      "text": "所以$x\\neq k\\pi(k\\in\\mathbf{Z})$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L022",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 22,
      "order": 22,
      "text": "所以函数$f(x)$ 的定义域为$\\left\\{x\\mid x\\neq k\\pi,k\\in\\mathbf{Z}\\right\\}$ …4分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L023",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 23,
      "order": 23,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）$f(x)=\\frac{1-\\cos^{2}x}{\\sin x}=\\frac{\\sin^{2}x}{\\sin x}=\\sin x$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L024",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 24,
      "order": 24,
      "text": "由$f(\\theta)=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}$ ，得$\\sin\\theta=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L025",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 25,
      "order": 25,
      "text": "又因为$\\theta\\in(\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\pi)$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P5L026",
      "page_no": 5,
      "line_no_in_page": 26,
      "order": 26,
      "text": "所以$\\cos\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\sin^{2}\\theta}=-\\sqrt{1-\\frac{4}{5}}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L001",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 1,
      "text": "所以$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}=\\frac{\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}}{-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}}=-2.$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L002",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "text": "所以$\\cos(\\pi-2\\theta)=-\\cos2\\theta=\\sin^2\\theta-\\cos^2\\theta=\\frac{3}{5}$ ……13分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L003",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 3,
      "order": 3,
      "text": "(19）(共14分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L004",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 4,
      "order": 4,
      "text": "解：（I）由题意可知：$f(x)=\\sin\\omega x\\cos\\omega x+\\sqrt{3}\\cos^{2}\\omega x-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L005",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 5,
      "order": 5,
      "text": "$$\\begin{aligned}=&\\frac{1}{2}\\sin2\\omega x+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cos2\\omega x\\\\=&\\sin2\\omega x\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\cos2\\omega x\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\\\=&\\sin\\left(2\\omega x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right).\\end{aligned}$$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L006",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 6,
      "order": 6,
      "text": "因为函数$f(x)$ 的最小正周期为元，所以$\\frac{2\\pi}{|2\\omega|}=\\pi$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L007",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 7,
      "order": 7,
      "text": "因为$\\omega>0$ ，所以$\\omega{=}1$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L008",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 8,
      "order": 8,
      "text": "所以$f(x)=\\sin\\left(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L009",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 9,
      "order": 9,
      "text": "由$2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+k\\pi,k\\in\\mathbf{Z}$ ，得$x=\\frac{\\pi}{12}+\\frac{k\\pi}{2},k\\in\\mathbf{Z}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L010",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 10,
      "order": 10,
      "text": "所以函数$f(x)$ 的对称轴方程为$x=\\frac{\\pi}{12}+\\frac{k\\pi}{2},k\\in\\mathbf{Z}$ ……8分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L011",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 11,
      "order": 11,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）由（I）知$f(x)=\\sin\\left(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L012",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 12,
      "order": 12,
      "text": "因为$x\\in(0,m)$ ，所以$2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\in\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3},2m+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L013",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 13,
      "order": 13,
      "text": "选择①，因为$f(x)$ 在区间(0,m)上恰好有两个零点.",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L014",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 14,
      "order": 14,
      "text": "所以$2\\pi<2m+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\leq3\\pi$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L015",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 15,
      "order": 15,
      "text": "所以$\\frac{5\\pi}{6}<m\\leq\\frac{4\\pi}{3}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L016",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 16,
      "order": 16,
      "text": "则m的取值范围是$(\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\frac{4\\pi}{3}]$ …14分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L017",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 17,
      "order": 17,
      "text": "选择②，因为$f(x)$ 在$(0,m)$ 上单调递增，",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L018",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 18,
      "order": 18,
      "text": "所以$\\frac{\\pi}{3}<2m+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\leq\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P6L019",
      "page_no": 6,
      "line_no_in_page": 19,
      "order": 19,
      "text": "所以$0<m\\leq\\frac{\\pi}{12}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L001",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 1,
      "text": "则m的取值范围是$(0,\\frac{\\pi}{12}]$ 14分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L002",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "text": "选择③，因为在区间$(0,m)$ 上有$f(x)\\geqslant0$ 恒成立.",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L003",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 3,
      "order": 3,
      "text": "所以$\\frac{\\pi}{3}<2m+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\leq\\pi$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L004",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 4,
      "order": 4,
      "text": "所以$0<m\\leq\\frac{\\pi}{3}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L005",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 5,
      "order": 5,
      "text": "则m的取值范围是$(0,\\frac{\\pi}{3}]$ 14分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L006",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 6,
      "order": 6,
      "text": "(20)(共15分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L007",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 7,
      "order": 7,
      "text": "解：（I）因为$f\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{k}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L008",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 8,
      "order": 8,
      "text": "所以$k=1$ …3分",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L009",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 9,
      "order": 9,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）对任意$x_{1},x_{2}\\in\\mathbf{R}$ ，且$x_{1}<x_{2}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L010",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 10,
      "order": 10,
      "text": "$f(x_{1})-f(x_{2})=\\frac{1}{4^{x_{1}}+2}-\\frac{1}{4^{x_{2}}+2}=\\frac{4^{x_{2}}+2-4^{x_{1}}-2}{(4^{x_{1}}+2)(4^{x_{2}}+2)}=\\frac{4^{x_{2}}-4^{x_{1}}}{(4^{x_{1}}+2)(4^{x_{2}}+2)}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L011",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 11,
      "order": 11,
      "text": "因为$x_{1}<x_{2}$ ，则$4^{x_{1}}<4^{x_{2}},\\quad4^{x_{2}}-4^{x_{1}}>0$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L012",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 12,
      "order": 12,
      "text": "又$\\left(4^{x_{1}}+2\\right)\\left(4^{x_{2}}+2\\right)>0$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L013",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 13,
      "order": 13,
      "text": "所以$\\frac{4^{x_{2}}-4^{x_{1}}}{\\left(4^{x_{1}}+2\\right)\\left(4^{x_{2}}+2\\right)}>0$ ，即$f(x_{1})-f(x_{2})>0$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L014",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 14,
      "order": 14,
      "text": "所以$f(x_{1})>f(x_{2})$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L015",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 15,
      "order": 15,
      "text": "所以函数$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 在R上单调递减.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L016",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 16,
      "order": 16,
      "text": "函数$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 的值域是$\\left(0,\\frac{1}{2}\\right)$ ……10分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L017",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 17,
      "order": 17,
      "text": "（Ⅲ）存在点$A\\left(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$ ，使得$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 的图象关于A对称.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L018",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 18,
      "order": 18,
      "text": "因为$f(1-x)=\\frac{1}{4^{1-x}+2}=\\frac{4^x}{4+2\\times4^x}=\\frac{4^x}{2(2+4^x)}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L019",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 19,
      "order": 19,
      "text": "则$f(x)+f(1-x)=\\frac{1}{4^{x}+2}+\\frac{4^{x}}{2(2+4^{x})}=\\frac{4^{x}+2}{2(2+4^{x})}=\\frac{1}{2}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L020",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 20,
      "order": 20,
      "text": "所以$f{\\big(}x{\\big)}$ 的图象关于点$\\left(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$ 对称.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L021",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 21,
      "order": 21,
      "text": "所以$a=\\frac{1}{2},b=\\frac{1}{4}$ .15分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L022",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 22,
      "order": 22,
      "text": "(21）(共15分)",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P7L023",
      "page_no": 7,
      "line_no_in_page": 23,
      "order": 23,
      "text": "解：（I）由题$n{=}16$ 时，$A_{16}=\\{1,2,4,8\\}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L001",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 1,
      "text": "当$B_{1}=\\{1,8\\},\\quad B_{2}=\\{2,4\\}$ 时，$d_{1}$ 取得最大值7.4分（Ⅱ）存在.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L002",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 2,
      "order": 2,
      "text": "不妨设$A_{n}=\\left\\{a_{1},a_{2},\\cdots,a_{2m}\\right\\}$ ,其中$1=a_{1}<a_{2}<\\cdots<a_{2m}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L003",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 3,
      "order": 3,
      "text": "$$\\frac{n}{a_{1}}>\\frac{n}{a_{2}}>\\cdots>\\frac{n}{a_{2m}} 且 \\frac{n}{a_{2}},\\cdots,\\frac{n}{a_{2m}}\\in A_{n},\\quad\\frac{n}{a_{1}}=n\\notin A_{n}$$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L004",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 4,
      "order": 4,
      "text": "$$\\left\\{a_{2},a_{3},\\cdots,a_{2m}\\right\\}=\\left\\{\\frac{n}{a_{2m}},\\frac{n}{a_{2m-1}},\\cdots,\\frac{n}{a_{2}}\\right\\}$$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L005",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 5,
      "order": 5,
      "text": "所以$\\frac{n}{a_{2m}}=a_{2},\\frac{n}{a_{2m-1}}=a_{3},\\cdots,\\frac{n}{a_{m+1}}=a_{m+1},\\cdots,\\frac{n}{a_{2}}=a_{2m}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L006",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 6,
      "order": 6,
      "text": "所以$n={a_{_{m+1}}}^{2}$ …9分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L007",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 7,
      "order": 7,
      "text": "（）不存在，理由如下：",
      "block_type": "text",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L008",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 8,
      "order": 8,
      "text": "假设存在n以及$B_{1},B_{2},\\cdots,B_{m}$ ，使得.$d_{1}=d_{2}=\\cdots=d_{m}=C$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L009",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 9,
      "order": 9,
      "text": "不妨设$A_{n}=\\left\\{a_{1},a_{2},\\cdots,a_{2m}\\right\\},1=a_{1}<a_{2}<\\cdots<a_{2m},$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L010",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 10,
      "order": 10,
      "text": "$B_{i}=\\left\\{x_{i},y_{i}\\right\\}$ ，其中$x_{i}>y_{i},x_{1}=a_{2m}\\quad(i=1,2,3,\\cdots,m)$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L011",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 11,
      "order": 11,
      "text": "则$C=\\left|x_{1}-y_{1}\\right|=a_{2m}-y_{1}\\geqslant a_{2m}-a_{2m-1}.$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L012",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 12,
      "order": 12,
      "text": "又因为$A_{n}$ 中大于$a_{_{m+1}}$ 的元素共$m-1$ 个，",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L013",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 13,
      "order": 13,
      "text": "所以$x_{1},x_{2},\\cdots,x_{m}$ 中，必有一个数小于或等于$a_{_{m+1}}$ ，设$x_{2}\\leq a_{m+1}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L014",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 14,
      "order": 14,
      "text": "所以$C=\\left|x_{2}-y_{2}\\right|<x_{2}\\leq a_{m+1}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L015",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 15,
      "order": 15,
      "text": "由（Ⅱ）可知$a_{m+1}=\\sqrt{n}$ ，所以$a_{2m}-a_{2m-1}\\leq C<\\sqrt{n}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L016",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 16,
      "order": 16,
      "text": "所以$\\frac{n}{a_{2}}-\\frac{n}{a_{3}}<\\sqrt{n}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L017",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 17,
      "order": 17,
      "text": "因为$a_{\\gamma}$ 是n的除1外最小的因数，所以$a_{2}$ 为素数",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L018",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 18,
      "order": 18,
      "text": "①若$a_{3}$ 也是素数，则$\\frac{1}{a_{2}a_{3}}\\leqslant\\frac{a_{3}-a_{2}}{a_{2}a_{3}}<\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L019",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 19,
      "order": 19,
      "text": "所以$\\sqrt{n}<a_{2}a_{3}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L020",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 20,
      "order": 20,
      "text": "因为$\\frac{n}{a_{2}}\\in\\mathbf{N}^{*},\\frac{n}{a_{3}}\\in\\mathbf{N}^{*}$ ，所以$\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{a_{2}}\\in\\mathbf{N}^{*},\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{a_{3}}\\in\\mathbf{N}^{*}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L021",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 21,
      "order": 21,
      "text": "所以$\\frac{\\sqrt{n}}{a_{2}a_{3}}\\in\\mathbf{N}^{*}$ .这与$\\sqrt{n}<a_{2}a_{3}$ 矛盾.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L022",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 22,
      "order": 22,
      "text": "②若$a_{3}$ 不是素数，则$a_{3}={a_{2}}^{2}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L023",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 23,
      "order": 23,
      "text": "由$\\frac{a_{2}-1}{a_{2}^{2}}<\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}$ 且_$a_{2}\\geqslant2$ ，可得$\\frac{1}{a_{2}^{2}}\\leqslant\\frac{a_{2}-1}{a_{2}^{2}}<\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}$ ，所以$\\sqrt{n}<{a_{_2}}^{^2}$",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P8L024",
      "page_no": 8,
      "line_no_in_page": 24,
      "order": 24,
      "text": "所以$a_{m+1}<a_2^{2}=a_3$ ，与题设中$m\\geqslant2$ 矛盾.",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    },
    {
      "line_id": "P9L001",
      "page_no": 9,
      "line_no_in_page": 1,
      "order": 1,
      "text": "综上不存在n以及$B_{1},B_{2},\\cdots,B_{m}$ ，使得$d_{1}=d_{2}=\\cdots=d_{m}$ ……15分",
      "block_type": "formula",
      "source": "ppsv3",
      "continuation": false
    }
  ]
}